commit fa2b99e8
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-24 01:35:07 -0600
subject: fix(rebase): resolve 13 post-rebase test regressions (35→22)

- codex-image-models: toMatchObject for betaMarker field (master addition)
- translator cluster 6/6: remove stale it.fails (bugs fixed upstream),
  add mediaType to commandcode expectations, fix GLM-5.2
  thinkingEffortSupported capability, restore reasoning_content→thinking
  block in openai-to-claude, regenerate Kiro golden snapshot
- openai-to-commandcode: add mediaType to image block expectations
- deno-deploy: restore cleanup DELETE error logging (lost in rebase)
- jwt-secret-deployment: restore production NODE_ENV throw + dev warn
- codex-image-fetch: build data URI from fetched buffer (Codex backend
  cannot reach remote URLs)
- request-details-tab: use .all() for backup table existence check

Full suite: 3540 pass / 46 fail / 22 regressions (was 35)


